<title>USA: IBM internet banking news conference 1330edt.</title>
<headline>IBM internet banking news conference 1330edt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Business Machines Corp will unveil an internet banking alliance with major U.S. banks at a news conference to be held in New York at 1330 EDT/1730 GMT Monday afternoon, IBM said.</p>
<p>The news conference will be attended by Louis Gerstner, chairman and chief executive officer of IBM, and executives of several banks, including the chief executive officers of KeyCorp, Royal Bank of Canada, Banc One Corp and Barnett Banks Inc and the chief information officer of NationsBank Corp.</p>
</text>
